Package: iwbsurv
Type: Package
Title: Information-Weighted Blending for Survival Extrapolation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hao", "Chen", email = "hche2036@uni.sydney.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Clara", "Grazian", role = "aut"))
Description: Survival extrapolation combining a Royston-Parmar observation
    model with an uncertain, conditionally anchored Gompertz tail. Relative
    log-increment dispersion determines a monotone blending weight, and a
    common scaling factor enforces non-negative evaluated hazards across
    retained draws. Includes pointwise uncertainty intervals, a Beta blending
    comparator, borrowing summaries, and plotting methods.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: flexsurv, survival, scam, mgcv, stats, graphics, grDevices, utils
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/iwbsurv
BugReports: https://github.com/haohaostats/iwbsurv/issues
